WEBVTT

00:02:58.319 --> 00:03:01.340
I'm going to try to square
some three-digit numbers this time.

00:03:01.364 --> 00:03:02.976
I won't even write these down --

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.477
I'll just call them out
as they're called out to me.

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:07.976
Anyone I point to, call out
a three-digit number.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.196
Anyone on our panel, verify the answer.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:12.243
Just give some indication if it's right.

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:14.870
A three-digit number, sir, yes?

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:15.976
Audience: 987.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.459
AB: 987 squared is 974,169.

00:03:19.483 --> 00:03:21.563
(Laughter)

00:03:21.587 --> 00:03:23.257
AB: Yes? Good.

00:03:23.281 --> 00:03:24.977
Another three-digit --

00:03:25.001 --> 00:03:26.931
(Applause)

00:03:26.955 --> 00:03:29.393
-- another three-digit number, sir?

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:30.423
Audience: 457.